  "background": [
    {
      "name": "Veteran Guard",
      "source": "SRDLite",
      "skillProficiencies": [
        {
          "athletics": true,
          "intimidation": true
        }
      ],
      "entries": [
        {
          "type": "entries",
          "name": "Feature: Watchful Eye",
          "entries": [
            "Your time on watch lets you notice trouble before it starts. You can often find a safe place to rest within a settlement and gain a friendly contact among the local guard."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "colLabels": [
            "d4",
            "Personality Trait"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "1",
              "I always have a plan for when things go wrong."
            ],
            [
              "2",
              "I face problems head-on. A simple, direct solution is the best path."
            ],
            [
              "3",
              "I keep watch while others sleep, whether they ask me to or not."
            ],
            [
              "4",
              "I judge people by their deeds, not their words."
            ]
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Wandering Scholar",
      "source": "SRDLite",
      "skillProficiencies": [
        {
          "arcana": true,
          "history": true
        }
      ],
      "entries": [
        {
          "type": "entries",
          "name": "Feature: Researcher",
          "entries": [
            "When you try to learn or recall a piece of lore, you often know where and from whom you can obtain it."
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
